[I] A wlroots based Wayland compositor mostly used on mobile phones

[T] A wlroots based Wayland compositor mostly used on mobile phones. Often used
[T] as part of Phosh but works perfectly well on its own.

[U] https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/phoc

[A] Phosh Devs
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL3 LGPL MIT
[V] 0.58.0

[D] 749b2e91363ebdbfe2e0459d98187e4fcebe994d78a9ce05935d5121 phoc-v0.58.0.tar.bz2 https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/phoc/-/archive/v0.58.0/

var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dembed-wlroots=disabled
var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dtests=false
pkginstalled docutils && var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dman=true
pkginstalled gtk-doc && var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dgtk_doc=true
